OL,3,GNEWSAMan found dead by major A-road was
OL,4,Astruck by lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA factory worker found dead by the side
OL,7,Fof a major A-road died of a severe head
OL,8,Finjury after being struck by a lorry,
OL,9,Fan inquest has heard.
OL,11,FNerijus Vysniauskas, 26, was discovered
OL,12,Fbeside the A47 near King's Lynn, at
OL,13,Fabout 09:20 GMT on 2 December 2024.
OL,15,FDrivers told Norfolk Coroner's Court
OL,16,Fthey had earlier seen a pedestrian in
OL,17,Fdark clothing walking with their back
OL,18,Fto traffic on a narrow verge next to
OL,19,Fthe unlit carriageway. One witness said
OL,20,Fthey had to swerve to avoid him.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
