OL,4,Astruck by lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlastic fragments from a lorry were
OL,7,Ffound next to Vysniauskas' body. A man
OL,8,Fin his 60s was arrested in Reading,
OL,9,FBerkshire, with the case against him
OL,10,Flater dropped.
